    "details": "<p dir=\"ltr\" data-path-to-node=\"0\"><strong>Codathon 1.0 <em data-path-to-node=\"0\" data-index-in-node=\"13\">(Presented by Forge &amp; Ship)</em></strong></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" data-path-to-node=\"1\">A high-intensity, multi-level individual hackathon designed to test your logic, technical skills, and rapid execution.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" data-path-to-node=\"3\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Eligibility:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" data-path-to-node=\"4,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Participant Type:</strong> Individual participation only (no teams allowed).</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" data-path-to-node=\"4,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"4,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Target Audience:</strong> Open to all college students across <strong data-path-to-node=\"4,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"53\">1st year, 2nd year, pre-final year, and final year</strong>.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" data-path-to-node=\"4,2,0\"><em data-path-to-node=\"4,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Exclusions:</em> Working professionals/corporate freshers and school students are not eligible.</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Event Format &amp; Process:</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" data-path-to-node=\"7\">The competition runs in <strong data-path-to-node=\"7\" data-index-in-node=\"24\">three elimination rounds</strong>:</p>\n<ul dir=\"ltr\" data-path-to-node=\"8\">\n<li>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Round 1: Aptitude Screening</strong></p>\n<ul dir=\"ltr\" data-path-to-node=\"8,0,1\">\n<li>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" data-path-to-node=\"8,0,1,0,0\"><em data-path-to-node=\"8,0,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Format:</em> Online MCQ test.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" data-path-to-node=\"8,0,1,1,0\"><em data-path-to-node=\"8,0,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Focus:</em> Quantitative aptitude, logical reasoning, and core computer science fundamentals.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Round 2: Technical Assessment</strong></p>\n<ul dir=\"ltr\" data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1\">\n<li>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1,0,0\"><em data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Format:</em> Online coding and algorithmic challenge.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1,1,0\"><em data-path-to-node=\"8,1,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Focus:</em> Data Structures, Algorithms (DSA), and problem-solving speed.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Round 3: The Build &amp; Ship Phase (Finals)</strong></p>\n<ul dir=\"ltr\" data-path-to-node=\"8,2,1\">\n<li>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" data-path-to-node=\"8,2,1,0,0\"><em data-path-to-node=\"8,2,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Format:</em> Core hackathon problem statement release.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" data-path-to-node=\"8,2,1,1,0\"><em data-path-to-node=\"8,2,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Focus:</em> Solo participants build, deploy, and submit a working prototype within the given timeline.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" data-path-to-node=\"10\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Rules &amp; Guidelines:</strong></p>\n<ul dir=\"ltr\" data-path-to-node=\"11\">\n<li>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Solo Execution:</strong> All code, design, and logic must be written entirely by the registered individual. Plagiarism or collaboration will result in immediate disqualification.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Submissions:</strong> All project code and deployment links must be submitted through the official platform portal before the timer runs out. Extensions will not be granted.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Integrity:</strong> Use of AI coding assistants is subject to event guidelines; standard online documentation is permitted, but copy-pasting complete solutions from external sources is prohibited.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
